tries and international  community was like  watching over but there are so many  manufacturing sectors that exist in the  country  which is absolutely overlooked the  international labor organization  says the rope gun fire highlights the  importance of safety measures  for building construction in bangladesh  and elsewhere  but for many relatives who lost loved  ones it will be a case of too little too  late  and workers feel let down that adequate  safety measures  are not in place tanvi choudhary  al-jazeera  rob ganj bangladesh
 

